# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:The Feud" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Getting started
1	line	Ali Morrisane	Good day and welcome back to Al Kharid.
1	line	Ali Morrisane	My name is Ali Morrisane - the greatest salesman in the world.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Are you really the greatest salesman in the world?
2	line	Player	If you're the greatest salesman in the world, why are you still selling goods from a stall?
2	line	Ali Morrisane	Well one can only do and sell so much. If I had more staff I'd be able to sell more, rather than wasting my time on menial things. I could get on with selling sand to the Bedabin and useless tourist trinkets to just about
2	line	Ali Morrisane	everyone else.
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	I'm too busy to help. Adventuring is a full time job you know!
3	line	Player	I'm too busy to help. Adventuring is a full time job you know!
3	line	Ali Morrisane	No problem my friend, perhaps another time.
3	line	Ali Morrisane	Anyway, have a look at my wares.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	No, I'm really too busy.
4	action	end
3	option	Okay.
4	action	
2	option	I'd like to help you, but...
3	line	Player	I'd like to help you but...
3	line	Ali Morrisane	Yes, I know, I know - the life of a shop keeper isn't slaying dragons and wooing damsels, but it has its charms.
3	line	Ali Morrisane	Although perhaps you can help me some other way. A nephew of mine lives not too far from here in a little town called Pollnivneach. He was supposed to become my assistant, but he hasn't shown up. If you fetch him
3	line	Ali Morrisane	here I'll give you the first month of his salary!
3	cond	If the player has a combat level less than 40:
4	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that your combat level is lower than the recommended level of 40.
3	select	Start The Feud quest?
3	option	Yes.
4	line	Player	I'll find your nephew.
4	line	Player	But you had better become the greatest merchant in Gielinor once I succeed!
4	line	Ali Morrisane	Ah, many thanks, my friend. My nephew's name is Ali and he lives to the south in a town called Pollnivneach.
4	line	Ali Morrisane	Tell him his uncle Ali M needs his help up in Al Kharid.
4	line	Ali Morrisane	And while you're here, have a look at my wares.
4	select	Select an Option
4	option	No, I'm really too busy.
5	action	end
4	option	Okay.
