0	section	Asking the locals
0	section	Talking to Ali Morrisane before any other progress
1	line	Ali Morrisane	I sent you to learn the whereabouts of my nephew, Ali. Is there any word of him in Pollnivneach?
1	line	Player	Not yet, I'm afraid.
1	line	Ali Morrisane	That's not really the news I was hoping for.
1	line	Ali Morrisane	But since you've been gone trade has gotten even busier. Will you have a look at my wares?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	No, I'm really too busy.
2	action	end
