0	section	Talking to a Menaphite Thug
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Greetings Adventurer, Ali wants to have a word with you.
1	line	Player	Really? Which one?
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Ali, our Chief of Operations. He should be somewhere nearby the tent.
1	line	Player	Thanks.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Operator
1	line	Ali the Operator	You seem to be a man of action. We could do with more people like you to sort those despicable bandits out.
1	line	Player	Yeah, those pesky bandits!
1	line	Ali the Operator	So will you join us in our fight to wipe them out?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Yes, of course, those bandits should be taught a lesson.
2	line	Player	Yes, of course, those pesky bandits should be taught a lesson.
2	line	Ali the Operator	Good choice my friend, together we will crush them.
2	line	Player	So when do we start?
2	line	Ali the Operator	Slow down, slow down. First you must prove yourself capable and trustworthy.
2	line	Player	How will I manage that?
2	line	Ali the Operator	Don't worry about that, I'll just set you a few jobs to do.
2	line	Ali the Operator	As you might have gathered we have a less-than- sparkling reputation around here.
2	line	Ali the Operator	So I want you to foster this reputation and grow it.
2	line	Player	What exactly does that mean?
2	line	Ali the Operator	It means that I want you to go out into the town and pickpocket three villagers, then report back to me.
2	line	Ali the Operator	If you have any problems don't be afraid to ask for some advice.
2	line	Player	Oh right, thanks.
2	line	Ali the Operator	Can I help you with anything else?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Yes I'd like to ask you about something else.
3	line	Player	Yes I'd like to ask you about something else.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	Tell me about yourself.
4	line	Player	Tell me about yourself.
