0	section	Welcome to the Menaphites
0	section	Talking to Ali the Operator
1	line	Ali the Operator	Well done! You have finished your first trial.
1	line	Player	First trial?
1	line	Ali the Operator	You didn't think we'd hire you off the back of a couple of pick-pocketings, did you?
1	line	Player	Ah, of course not.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Good! Now, the next thing you have to do is a spot of burglary.
1	line	Ali the Operator	The only place worth pilfering around here is the mayor's villa.
1	line	Ali the Operator	I want you to retrieve his wife's jewels.
1	line	Player	Got any advice?
1	line	Ali the Operator	Well I think that a disguise would be a good start. After that I would stake out the place to make sure he's not in.
1	line	Ali the Operator	You'll need a key to the front door, too.
1	cond	If the player has a full inventory:
2	line	Player	I can't carry anything else.
2	line	Ali the Operator	Well then come back to me again when you are ready. Don't be too long.
2	action	end
1	cond	Otherwise:
2	box	Ali the Operator hands you a set of keys.
2	line	Player	Anything else?
2	line	Ali the Operator	No! Now get going.
2	action	end
0	section	Staking out the house
