2	box	Ali the Operator hands you a set of keys.
2	action	end
1	cond	Otherwise:
2	line	Ali the Operator	So what's the problem? Have you created a disguise yet?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Yes of course.
3	line	Player	Yes of course.
3	line	Ali the Operator	Then make sure that you stake the place out to make sure neither the mayor or his family are inside.
3	line	Ali the Operator	Can I help you with anything else?
3	action	end
2	option	Now that you mention it, I'm having a few problems with that.
3	line	Player	Now that you mention it, yes I am having problems with the disguise.
3	line	Ali the Operator	You'll have to create something that will hide your hair and obscure your facial features.
3	line	Ali the Operator	Make sure you're wearing a pair of gloves so that you don't leave any incriminating finger prints.
3	line	Ali the Operator	You should have all this equipped before you stake out the house.
3	line	Ali the Operator	Can I help you with anything else?
3	action	end
