0	section	Searching the Mayor's Landscape
1	box	On the wall hangs a rather nondescript picture. On closer inspection you notice that it's covering something: a safe.
1	action	Safe interface opens.
1	cond	Upon failing the combination:
2	box	A rather loud clank reverberates from the safe. It sounds as if you've gotten the combination wrong. You wonder how many more attempts you have before the safe permanently locks itself.
2	action	end
1	cond	Upon resetting the safe:
2	box	Clank!! That must be the safe resetting itself.
1	cond	Upon unlocking the safe:
2	cond	If the player has a full inventory:
3	box	The mayor's jewels are contained within the safe, however you have no room in your inventory to take them.
3	action	end
2	cond	Otherwise:
3	box	You remove the jewels from the safe.
3	action	end
0	section	Now you've stolen the jewels
0	section	Talking to Ali the Mayor
1	line	Ali the Mayor	I really can't chat for very long, the recent escalation in crime has me run off my feet. Just a short while ago even my own house was robbed. This cannot continue.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Operator
1	line	Player	I've completed your task.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Impressive, I didn't expect you to crack that safe so quickly. Did you have help?
1	line	Player	Of course not, although the mayor did leave a number of hints lying around.
1	line	Ali the Operator	That man is a fool. Now give me the jewels.
1	cond	If the player does not have the jewels:
2	line	Player	Actually I seem to have misplaced them.
2	line	Ali the Operator	You are trying my patience. Hurry back with the jewels. Don't disappoint me.
2	action	end
1	cond	Otherwise:
2	box	You hand Ali the Operator the jewels.
2	line	Ali the Operator	Now, your final task is one of the upmost importance. It has come to my attention that there is a traitor in our midst.
2	line	Player	Oh really?
2	line	Ali the Operator	Yes, and I want you to root them out.
2	line	Player	Why me?
2	line	Ali the Operator	Because I feel like I can trust you. You don't have the emotional baggage that comes with playing the villain your entire life.
2	line	Player	Aw! You can count on me to find the traitor.
2	line	Ali the Operator	Well then get to it.
2	action	end
0	section	Searching for the traitor
