1	line	Ali the Operator	How is the search for the traitor going?
1	line	Player	Still no breakthrough.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Make sure you interview our other members. They may know more than they let on.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Can I help you with anything else?
1	action	above
0	section	Talking to a Menaphite Thug
1	line	Player	I was wondering if you could help me?
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Tell me what your problem is and I'll see what I can do.
1	line	Player	I've heard there's a traitor among the Menaphites. What do you know about it?
1	line	Menaphite Thug	It wasn't me, I swear!
1	line	Player	Really? So what do you know?
1	line	Menaphite Thug	I just can't believe one of my friends could be a traitor.
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Well, I suppose there is Traitorous Ali.
1	line	Player	'Traitorous Ali'?
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Oh yes. The most untrustworthy, backstabbing little rat to scamper across Tumeken's fair desert. He'd sell his own mother to slavers if he hadn't already betrayed her and had her locked up for the last job he pulled.
1	line	Player	I suppose the name is a bit of a giveaway.
1	line	Player	That was a little too simple, are you sure it was him?
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Positive, he was turned by the offer of a set of waterproofs and a ride on a camel.
1	line	Player	I see he drives a hard bargain.
1	line	Menaphite Thug	Well what can I say? We don't call him 'Ali of the Good Decisions', do we?
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Operator again
1	line	Player	I have discovered the identity of the traitor. It was...
1	line	Player	Traitorous Ali!
1	line	Ali the Operator	No! I would never have suspected Traitorous Ali.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Well, there was that time he sold out his entire family for a sandpit and an umbrella.
1	line	Ali the Operator	But I'm sure it took much more for him to betray us!
1	line	Player	Actually he sold you out for...
1	line	Ali the Operator	Stop, I don't want to know. It hurts too much already. Find him and then kill him, but do it quietly. I don't want a fuss.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Can I help you with anything else?
1	action	above
