1	line	Player	I'm still working on it.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Well don't waste time talking to me. Get on with it.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Barman
1	line	Player	Hello there.
1	line	Ali the Barman	Good day. Can I help you with anything?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Yes, I'd like a drink please.
2	line	Player	Yes, I'd like a drink please.
2	action	
1	option	What's going on in town?
2	line	Player	What's going on in town?
2	line	Ali the Barman	Nothing much really. About what you'd expect from a sleepy little town like ours.
2	line	Player	What about those two gangs? That seems exciting.
2	line	Ali the Barman	They're paying customers, so I won't rock the boat if you don't mind.
2	line	Ali the Barman	Is there anything else I can help you with?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	No thanks, I'm ok.
3	line	Player	No thanks, I'm ok. Thanks for your time.
3	action	end
2	option	Yes, I'd like to talk about something else.
3	action	initial
1	option	I'm looking for Traitorous Ali.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for Traitorous Ali.
2	line	Ali the Barman	He was just here! Look, he's even left his drink on the table by those barrels. Must have nipped out to go to the toilet.
2	line	Ali the Barman	He might be gone a while though. The nearest outhouse is all the way over on Fossil Island.
2	line	Ali the Barman	Is there anything else I can help you with?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	No thanks, I'm ok.
3	line	Player	No thanks, I'm ok. Thanks for your time.
3	action	end
2	option	Yes, I'd like to talk about something else.
3	action	initial
1	option	I'm looking for Ali from Pollnivneach.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for Ali from Pollnivneach.
2	line	Ali the Barman	Well, I'm called Ali and I'm from here. Are you looking for me?
2	line	Player	Do you have an uncle called Ali?
2	line	Ali the Barman	Yes! All my uncles are called Ali!
2	line	Player	Oh dear. Well do any of your uncles have a stall in the Bazaar in Al Kharid?
2	line	Ali the Barman	Um... no.
2	line	Player	Well do you know if anyone here does?
2	line	Ali the Barman	That's a difficult question to answer. I don't know anyone else's uncles.
2	line	Ali the Barman	Is there anything else I can help you with?
2	action	above
1	option	The 'Asp and Snake'? What a strange name for a bar.
2	line	Player	The 'Asp and Snake'? What a strange name for a bar.
2	line	Ali the Barman	Maybe around these parts. Were you expecting it to have 'Ali' in the name?
2	line	Ali the Barman	I did think about calling it 'Ali's', but then it'd get confused with the Camel Shop, the Kebab House, the Mayor's residence...
2	line	Player	Yes, I get your point. It's a perfectly fine name.
2	line	Ali the Barman	Is there anything else I can help you with?
2	action	above
0	section	Talking to Ali the Hag
1	line	Player	Good day, Hag.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Now what do you want? A hex? A spot potion? Power, beauty, eternal youth, etcetera?
1	line	Player	Actually I just want your help to, erm, remove someone. It's simple enough!
1	line	Ali the Hag	Ahh, I see. But I warn you, stranger - extinguishing the flame of life is simple, but people rarely wish to face the consequences, and I doubt you are any different.
1	line	Player	Don't worry about the consequences - I need it carried out in a manner which would draw no suspicion to me.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Well now this is getting interesting. I'd recommend a poisoning. Who do you wish dead? I need to know so that I may tailor a poison to their specific needs.
1	line	Player	'Traitorous Ali', please.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Traitorous Ali? Say no more! That wretch traded his grandmother's house for a jar of pickled aubergines! I believe he'll be easily gotten rid of...
1	line	Player	What payment do you require?
1	line	Ali the Hag	None at all - I will extract much pleasure from his passing. Just bring me the ingredients I require.
1	line	Player	What do you need?
1	line	Ali the Hag	Ah, impatience! Traitorous Ali's time is indeed nigh. Firstly bring me some snake venom, which will act as the main toxin.
1	line	Player	Where would I get some snake poison?
1	line	Ali the Hag	From a snake perhaps?
1	line	Player	What I meant was how do I extract the poison from the snake?
1	line	Ali the Hag	Sheesh! You'd make a terrible hag. Just bring me a snake with teeth in its head - and don't even think of giving me that snake charmer's pet worm, it's about as dangerous as a rubber knife.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Hag again
1	line	Player	Good day, Hag.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Have you got a snake yet?
1	line	Player	No, I'm still working on that.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Well don't bother me again until you do!
1	action	end
