1	line	Player	Good day, Hag.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Player	I have the snake. What else do you need?
1	line	Ali the Hag	Ah yes, that snake will do nicely. Hello, you wriggly little cutie!
1	line	Ali the Hag	Who's a vindictive little beast? You are! You are!
1	line	Player	Erm, yes. Do you need anything else?
1	line	Ali the Hag	Now that I have the toxin I need something to hide its trace. Fresh camel dung should do the job.
1	line	Player	What? That's disgusting.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Do you want the poison or not?
1	line	Player	Fine, fine, I'll get some camel dung.
1	line	Ali the Hag	And make that fresh camel dung! Nice and stinky. Now hand over that venomous little darling before it takes a bite out of you.
1	line	Player	Oops! I almost forgot!
1	box	You hand the basket with the charmed snake over to the old hag.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Hag again
1	line	Player	Good day, Hag.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Do you have the camel dung yet?
1	line	Player	No, I'm still working on that.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Well don't come back until you have it!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ali the Hag with Ughthanki dung
1	line	Player	Good day, Hag.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Here's your poison!
1	line	Player	Wow, that was quick!
1	line	Ali the Hag	Actually I already had it brewing. I just needed the ingredients for another batch.
1	line	Ali the Hag	You wouldn't believe the demand. It's been murder!
1	line	Player	That's not even remotely funny.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Sorry, I've been dying to say that for ages.
1	line	Player	Just stop. Thanks for the poison and good day to you.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Wait! Just remember, this poison isn't designed to be used on a weapon. In fact it's not a contact poison at all. You'll have to do more than just smear it on a blade!
1	line	Player	Got it. Thanks again!
1	box	You hand over your bucket of fresh camel dung and receive a vial of poison in return.
1	action	end
0	section	The end of Traitorous Ali
0	section	Talking to Ali the Hag
1	line	Player	Good day, Hag.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Player	I was wondering if I could have another batch of poison?
1	line	Ali the Hag	Why? Was the first batch not good enough?
1	cond	If the player has the Hag's poison in their inventory:
2	line	Player	Well no, I was just being greedy and wanted another batch for no good reason.
2	line	Ali the Hag	Well if that's the case, no! I have better things to be doing than continuously brewing poisons for people who have no use for it.
2	action	end
1	cond	Otherwise:
2	line	Player	I lost the first batch.
2	line	Ali the Hag	What? How do you just lose a batch of the most potent poison in all of Gielinor? It's even more deadly than the jungle karambwan.
2	line	Player	It's a long and not very interesting story.
2	line	Ali the Hag	Well alright, I'll give you another batch this once.
2	action	(The player receives another Hag's poison.)
2	action	end
