1	line	Ali the Hag	Good day to you too, Blockhead.
1	line	Ali the Hag	Have you good reason to disturb me again?
1	line	Player	Nope!
1	line	Ali the Hag	I warned you about needlessly bothering me. That's it! I'm turning you into a frog!
1	line	Player	Ribbit, ribbit!
1	line	Ali the Hag	Don't taunt me, fool! Once I find a spare minute you'll be ribbiting on the other side of your face, you mark my words!
1	action	end
