1	line	Ali the Operator	Is the deed done?
1	line	Player	Almost, his drink is poisoned. As soon as he gets back, he'll be done for.
1	line	Ali the Operator	Excellent work! Now, go speak with our boss.
1	line	Ali the Operator	He wants to discuss the future direction of the gang.
1	action	end
0	section	Meeting the leader
