1	line	Ali the Operator	What did the boss say?
1	line	Player	I haven't spoken with him yet.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to the Menaphite Leader
1	line	Player	Ali the Operator said you wanted to see me.
1	line	Menaphite Leader	That's right. I have kept a close eye on your progress. I'm impressed.
1	line	Player	So what are your plans for the bandits?
1	line	Menaphite Leader	The bandits? A mere nuisance, insignificant to my overall goal.
1	line	Player	Wait, if you're not warring with the bandits, what are you planning?
1	line	Menaphite Leader	World domination! First Pollnivneach, then Al Kharid, then the whole of the desert!
1	line	Player	What?
1	line	Menaphite Leader	You do understand who we are, don't you?
1	line	Player	Actually I thought you were a ragtag band of good-for- nothing thieves sucking the life out of this innocent town.
1	line	Menaphite Leader	Silence! We are the descendants of assassins, the heirs of the revolutionaries who defeated the corrupt pharaoh and his brood!
1	line	Menaphite Leader	For centuries we have wandered the desert, rebuilding the empire we were promised!
1	line	Menaphite Leader	Will you join us in our quest to defeat the thralls of Tumeken and reclaim our birthright?
1	cond	If the player has not completed Beneath Cursed Sands:
2	line	Player	Sorry, I have this irrational hatred for megalomaniac, despotic zealots! Prepare to meet your maker, you big jerk!
2	action	continue
1	cond	If the player has completed Beneath Cursed Sands:
2	line	Player	Wait, your great-great-great-great-grandparents were the ones who killed Osmumten?
2	line	Menaphite Leader	Who?
2	line	Player	You don't even know his name, and you claim to be the heirs to his empire? Come on.
2	line	Player	You're just a bunch of petty tyrants looking for an excuse to hurt people.
2	line	Menaphite Leader	Be careful what you say! We are loyal servants of the Devourer!
2	line	Player	I hope so, because you're about to meet her in person. This is for Mehhar!
2	action	continue
1	line	Menaphite Leader	Fool! You'll never get to me. Guards protect me.
1	action	The Menaphite Leader summons the Tough Guy to attack the player.
1	action	end
