1	action	The Menaphite Thug attacks the player.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to the Menaphite Leader again
1	line	Menaphite Leader	Guards!
1	line	Tough Guy	Grr!
0	section	After defeating the Tough Guy
1	line	Menaphite Leader	You haven't seen the last of me!
1	action	Menaphite Leader teleports away.
1	line	Player	No doubt I haven't seen the last of you... but what about Ali's nephew?
1	line	Player	Maybe the villagers will feel more talkative now that I've rid them of these evil Menaphites. Who knows, they might even give me a reward!
1	action	end
0	section	Celebrating your victory
